---Main Data Flows---

--Manual Food Entry--

 - User Creates Meal
-> Searches USDA / Enters Values Manually
-> Selects Quantity
-> Caliip Calculates Calories
-> Saves To IndexedDB

--AI Photo Analysis--

 - User Takes Photo
-> Vue Sends Photo to Bun API
-> Bun API Calls OpenAI
-> OpenAI Returns Nutrition Data
-> Caliip Looks Up Nutritional Values In USDA
-> User Reviews And Corrects Them
-> Saves To IndexedDB

--Daily, Weekly, And Monthly Views--

 - Vue Queries IndexedDB Through Dexie
-> TypeScript Calculates Calorie Totals
-> Vuetify Displays Results
(No Internet Connection Is Required For Viewing Saved Meals.)


